  "description": "Countless marriage proposal rejections are nothing for Lamille Claude, a newly reincarnated character in the dark fantasy novel “The Broken Sword.” Her mission is to prevent the male lead, Roel Arnen, from succumbing to all his misery and becoming the story’s villain. To do so, she’ll need to bring him under her protection as her husband until he regains the ability to use his legs and reclaims his former glory. But it isn’t easy considering Roel’s reluctance to accept Lamille’s confessions of love. Will Lamille be able to win Roel’s heart in time to save him from his tragic fate? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
